{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow"]]},"metadata":{"extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE21handlesExternalEvents8matchingQrShySSG_tF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11OpenSwiftUI13UtilityWindowV","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"handlesExternalEvents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"matching"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlesExternalEvents"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"matching","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"conditions","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A set of strings that OpenSwiftUI compares against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the incoming user activity or URL to see if OpenSwiftUI","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can open a new scene instance to handle the external event.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"conditions"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene type that limits the kinds of external events for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which OpenSwiftUI opens a new instance."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When your app receives an external event like a user activity or a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"URL, OpenSwiftUI routes the event to a scene for processing. OpenSwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"selects the scene that receives the event according to the following"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rules, which it evaluates in order until it finds a destination scene:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"On platforms that support only a single scene per app, send","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the event to the one open scene.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Find an open scene that indicates it prefers to or can handle the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event, if any, and send the event to that scene. You use the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"View\/handlesExternalEvents(preferring:allowing:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" view modifier","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on a view inside the scene to register this preference.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Find a scene declaration with a ","type":"text"},{"code":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scene modifier containing ","type":"text"},{"code":"conditions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that match the external event.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Create a new instance of the first scene that matches and route the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event there.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Find the first scene declaration that doesn’t have the scene modifier.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Create a new instance of this scene and route the event there.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Make sure that at least one of these rules succeeds in your app for all"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"events that your app claims to handle. Also, make sure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that the scene that receives an event actually handles it. For example,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be sure that a scene that receives user activities handles them with an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"appropriate "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View\/onContinueUserActivity(_:perform:)"},{"type":"text","text":" view modifier."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Don’t confuse the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)"},{"type":"text","text":" scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"modifier with the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View\/handlesExternalEvents(preferring:allowing:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"view","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" modifier. You use the scene modifier to help OpenSwiftUI choose a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"new scene to open when no open scene handles an external event,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whereas you use the view modifier to indicate that an open scene can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or prefers to handle certain events."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Matching-an-event","text":"Matching an event"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To find a scene type that handles a particular external event, OpenSwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"compares a property of the event against the strings that you specify"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"conditions"},{"type":"text","text":" set. OpenSwiftUI examines the following event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"properties to perform the comparison:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/NSUserActivity","type":"text"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"like when your app handles Handoff, OpenSwiftUI uses the activity’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/NSUserActivity\/3238062-targetContentIdentifier","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property, or if that’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/NSUserActivity\/1418086-webpageurl","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property rendered as an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/URL\/1779984-absoluteString","type":"text"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/URL","type":"text"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"like when another process opens a URL that your app handles,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OpenSwiftUI uses the URL’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/URL\/1779984-absoluteString","type":"text"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An empty set of strings never matches. Similarly, empty strings never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"match. Conversely, as a special case, the string that contains only an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asterisk ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"*"},{"type":"text","text":") matches anything. The modifier performs string"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"comparisons that are case and diacritic insensitive."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"DocumentGroup","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" scenes ignore this modifier. Instead,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"document scenes decide whether to open a new scene to handle an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"external event by comparing the incoming URL or user activity’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/Foundation\/NSUserActivity\/1418086-webpageurl","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against the document group’s supported types.","type":"text"}]}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Choosing-a-window-to-open","text":"Choosing a window to open"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example shows an app with a photo browser scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that displays a collection of photos, and a photo detail scene that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enables closer examination of a particular photo:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["@main","struct MyPhotos: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            PhotosBrowser()","        }","","        WindowGroup(\"Photo\") {","            PhotoDetail()","        }","        .handlesExternalEvents(matching: [\"photoIdentifier=\"])","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The app uses the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)"},{"type":"text","text":" modifier on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"second scene to ensure that an external event with an identifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that contains the string "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"photoIdentifier="},{"type":"text","text":" creates a new scene of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the second type. Other events, if not handled by an open scene,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cause the creation of a new browser window instead."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/utilitywindow\/handlesexternalevents(matching:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Specifies the external events for which OpenSwiftUI opens a new instance","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"of the modified scene.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow\/handlesExternalEvents(matching:)"},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","role":"collection","abstract":[],"title":"OpenSwiftUI","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Scene":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scene"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A part of an app’s user interface with a life cycle managed by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system."}],"title":"Scene","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scene","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scene"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/UtilityWindow/handlesExternalEvents(matching:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/utilitywindow\/handlesexternalevents(matching:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlesExternalEvents"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"matching","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Specifies the external events for which OpenSwiftUI opens a new instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the modified scene."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"handlesExternalEvents(matching:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow\/handlesExternalEvents(matching:)"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/UtilityWindow":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"UtilityWindow"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A specialized window scene that provides secondary utility to the content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the main scenes of an application."}],"title":"UtilityWindow","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/utilitywindow","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"UtilityWindow"}],"type":"topic"}}}